  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/blob/master/img/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjava.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Made with-JAVA-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Java\"></a> <a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-ARR-red.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"授權：ARR\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/zitu8weW?logo=modrinth&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/zitu8weW?logo=modrinth&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_498797_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/498797.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"版本\"></a></p>\n<p>此模組簡單地在原版 Minecraft 中新增了更多蠑螈品種（它們擁有各自的 NBT 標籤，編號從 5 到 14）。</p>\n<p>與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/axolotl-bucket-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Axolotl Bucket Fix v1.1.1+</a>（僅限 Fabric）相容。</p>\n<p>從 1.2.0 版本起，需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Axolotl Variants API</a> 作為前置。</p>\n<p>召喚指令：</p>\n<p>/summon minecraft:axolotl [座標] {Variant:\"mavm:&lt;品種名稱&gt;\"}</p>\n<p>2.0.0 以上版本為：</p>\n<p>/summon minecraft:axolotl [座標] {variant:\"mavm:&lt;品種名稱&gt;\"}</p>\n<p>幽匿蠑螈和發光蠑螈只能透過繁殖獲得！</p>\n<p>1.0.8 更新已調整紋理以符合新版本的蠑螈外觀變更。<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/master/img/new_variants.png\" alt=\"全新蠑螈紋理！\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/master/img/new_variants_dark.png\" alt=\"全新蠑螈紋理！\"></p>\n<p>蠑螈品種列表：</p>\n<p>露西亞、野生、金色、綠色、幽匿、暗色、紅色、發光蠑螈、白色、氰藍。</p>\n<p>在 2.0.0 以上版本中，幽匿（Skulk）和暗色（Dark）已更名為 Sculk 和黑色！</p>",
